@kraftverk/integration-shelly

Ported to TypeScript from:

- Home Assistant's `shelly` integration
  (https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/shelly),
  Copyright the Home Assistant authors, licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0.
- aioshelly (https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/aioshelly), licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changed: rewritten in TypeScript for kraftverk's device model — the RPC and
its WebSocket over a byte channel, digest sign-in, the switch component as
an outlet that switches with its meter. No code was copied verbatim; the
protocol's behaviour follows aioshelly's and Shelly's published API
documentation (https://shelly-api-docs.shelly.cloud/gen2/).

